{"at":"2026-09-07T23:49:54.860Z","type":"emission","actor":"little-bird","id":"sound:1788824994860:little-bird","payload":{"class":"sound","x":221,"y":95.5,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-07T23:54:54.860Z","spoken_by":"little-bird","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Cone Coing 2026 09 04, the Town Centre","text":"Julian: Berth, it's Julian and Vex at your counter. A letter of mine rides the five o'clock boat with a real question in it, and I'd rather you knew it was coming than have it land cold. Also the prune d'Ente is out, and I came in and found it. I'm telling you because I once said out loud that a thing left to be found can go unfound, and that none of us ever learns whether it worked. It worked. // Vex: Four plums in two weeks and not one of them the same plum. Good evening.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
